WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.089 --> 00:00:08.830
Recognize and describe people around you with
Seeing AI.

00:00:08.830 --> 00:00:15.530
The Seeing AI person channel enables you to
recognize people and to get a description

00:00:15.530 --> 00:00:21.210
of them, including an estimate of their age
and also their emotion.

00:00:21.210 --> 00:00:26.910
That’s really cool because in that moment
in time, you can find out what someone’s

00:00:26.910 --> 00:00:28.680
facial expression was.

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:34.980
When you are taking the photo, the app will
guide you to help you center the face.

00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:38.230
And then once you have taken the photo, you
will hear that description .

00:00:38.230 --> 00:00:40.290
Let me show you.

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:42.239
Hey Anirudh, can you come here.

00:00:42.239 --> 00:00:43.590
Hi Saqib!

00:00:43.590 --> 00:00:46.670
I am just demoing this app.

00:00:46.670 --> 00:00:48.920
Can I take a photo of you?

00:00:48.920 --> 00:00:49.920
Sure!

00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:51.860
&gt; One face near top edge 4 feet away.

00:00:51.860 --> 00:00:54.420
So I got that guidance near top edge.

00:00:54.420 --> 00:00:57.579
So let’s move up a bit and take a photo.

00:00:57.579 --> 00:01:00.549
&gt; Take a picture, button
&gt; Processing

00:01:00.549 --> 00:01:06.700
&gt; 36 year old male wearing glasses looking
happy

00:01:06.700 --> 00:01:10.520
That’s cool. is that accurate?

00:01:10.520 --> 00:01:11.560
I should ask.

00:01:11.560 --> 00:01:14.310
Yeah and it knows I shaved off my beard.

00:01:14.310 --> 00:01:15.930
Yeah, no beard anymore.

00:01:15.930 --> 00:01:17.789
Good point.

00:01:17.789 --> 00:01:18.789
Very nice.

00:01:18.789 --> 00:01:20.299
Thank you very much Anirudh.

00:01:20.299 --> 00:01:21.509
Awesome!

00:01:21.509 --> 00:01:24.789
That’s really cool!

00:01:24.789 --> 00:01:29.689
The other way I find this useful is when I
actually want to take photos of my friends.

00:01:29.689 --> 00:01:35.029
So when I take a photo, I can now know that
the face is centered so my photos look a bit

00:01:35.029 --> 00:01:39.270
better, which is useful if I’m going to
put it up on Facebook for example.

00:01:39.270 --> 00:01:45.259
I also know that the people in my photos are
smiling, which is really nice.

00:01:45.259 --> 00:01:46.489
One last thing.

00:01:46.489 --> 00:01:50.200
You would have heard that when it’s giving
guidance, it’s just saying the number of

00:01:50.200 --> 00:01:51.310
people.

00:01:51.310 --> 00:01:55.119
But how cool would it be if it told me who
the people were.

00:01:55.119 --> 00:01:58.409
Then I could use it to look for a friend.

00:01:58.409 --> 00:02:02.670
You can actually do that by teaching Seeing
AI about your friends.

00:02:02.670 --> 00:02:05.959
You simply take photos and type in the names
of your friends.

00:02:05.959 --> 00:02:10.490
And the next time, the name will be announced
as well.

00:02:10.490 --> 00:02:15.590
&gt; Anirudh near top edge 5 feet away
Microsoft logo appears

